  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Anyone moves the parts of a stranded exit whose party can receive now, judged as `transact`\\njudges it, back into the exit queue, at its tail, as a new exit that `release` pays in turn\\nlike any other, and returns its ID. A part whose party still cannot receive stays stranded.\\nFails with `NothingClaimable` when no part can move. Refused while halted; works while\\npaused.",
      "name": "claim",
      "inputs": [
